OL,3,GNEWSA'Biggest Asian hornet nest of
OL,4,Aseason' removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe biggest Asian hornet nest found
OL,7,Fthis season in Guernsey has been
OL,8,Fremoved, pest experts say.
OL,10,FAgriculture, Countryside and Land
OL,11,FManagement Services (ACLMS) said staff
OL,12,Fused a cherry picker to access the nest
OL,13,Fin La Guet, Castel, on 7 September
OL,14,Fafter it was located in a tree in the
OL,15,Fwooded area. There was an estimated
OL,16,F2,000 hornets in it nest, it added.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
