OL,3,GNEWSA'Biggest Asian hornet nest of
OL,4,Aseason' removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnelotte Baas-Jehan, invasive
OL,7,Fnon-native species policy and
OL,8,Fcoordination officer, said: "Because it
OL,9,Fwas a large nest, we needed to use a
OL,10,Fhigher dose of pesticides, which is why
OL,11,Fit took longer to take down."
OL,13,FShe added: "We've trapped more queens
OL,14,Fthis year than previously and seen an
OL,15,Fincrease in the amount of nests."
